<title>FRANCE: LVMH climbs on Guinness, GrandMet offer.</title>
<headline>LVMH climbs on Guinness, GrandMet offer.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in French luxury goods company LVMH rose sharply after company chairman Bernard Arnault proposed a merger of the drinks activities of LVMH, Guinness and GrandMetropolitan.</p>
<p>AT 1024 GMT the shares were up 2.47 percent at 1,618 francs.</p>
